@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Me";
}

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .about-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .about-left {
        background-color: #fff;
        width: 35%;
        min-width: 280px;
        padding: 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

        .about-left img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 300px;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about-left h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .about-left h5 {
            margin: 5px 0 25px 0;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #555;
        }

    .contact-btn {
        background-color: #2b2b2b;
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 300px;
    }

        .contact-btn:hover {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
        }

    .contact-dropdown-menu {
        background-color: #2b2b2b;
    }

        .contact-dropdown-menu .dropdown-item {
            text-align: left;
            white-space: normal;
        }

    .about-right {
        background-color: #3f4632;
        width: 65%;
        padding: 50px 60px;
        color: #fff;
    }

        .about-right h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }

        .about-right p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }
</style>

<div class="about-wrapper">

    <div class="about-left">
        <img src="~/image/Screenshot 2026-08-15 170207.png" />
        <h1><strong>Sino</strong></h1>
        <h5>Therapist</h5>

        <div class="dropdown">
            <button class="contact-btn dropdown-toggle" type="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                Contact Me
            </button>
            <ul class="dropdown-menu contact-dropdown-menu">
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="tel:0613397981">061 339 7981</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="mailto:info.recenterhub@gmail.com">info.recenterhub@gmail.com</a></li>
                <li><a class="dropdown-item">Pietermaritzburg, KZN</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-right">

        <p>Hi, I'm Sinolizwi — the founder of Re-Center Hub.</p>

        <p>I hold a Bachelor's degree in Child and Youth Care (Cum Laude) and Master's degree in Child and Youth Care from the Durban University of Technology.</p>

        <p>Over the years, I have worked in schools and boarding houses, providing counseling, youth development, and learner support. I've had the opportunity to walk alongside young people through some of their most important and vulnerable stages of life.</p>

        <p>My experience includes Psychosocial support, Youth development and mentorship, Wellness and intervention programmes, Life skills support and education, Creating inclusive and supportive environments for young people</p>

        <p>Through my work, I've seen the growing need for safe spaces where young people and families can receive guidance, support, healing, and empowerment.</p>

        <p>That vision is what led to the birth of Re-Center Hub — a space focused on rebuilding minds, re-centering lives, and helping individuals rediscover purpose and growth.</p>

        <p>I am passionate about creating meaningful change in communities by supporting emotional wellbeing, youth empowerment, mentorship, and personal development.</p>

        <p>Thank you for being part of this journey</p>

        <p>"A Hub for Growth. A Path to Purpose."</p>
    </div>

</div>